1
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,440
Guo Zijian's move to break into small units

2
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,920
is exactly what urban warfare calls for.

3
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,080
He caught on just in time.

4
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:49,080
But given their urban warfare skills,

5
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,440
they're just buying a little more time.

6
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,760
It has no real tactical significance.

7
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,240
Brigade Commander, we have new intel.

8
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,520
Which unit is at this position?

9
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,720
Why has there been no movement?

10
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,120
It's confirmed.

11
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,440
It's the unit from the highway,

12
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,720
the crippled Red Army 1st Company.

13
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,280
What are they doing hiding there?

14
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,120
Probably spooked from the beating they took.

15
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,960
Their personnel and equipment are well hidden.

16
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,920
And due to their solid troop deployment,

17
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,920
our assault teams can't get close.

18
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,280
In that case,

19
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:23,960
keep a close eye on them.

20
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,040
Yes, sir.

21
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,960
All companies, don't panic.

22
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,160
Establish a defensive line immediately.

23
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,000
What's going on?

24
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,480
We're under heavy electromagnetic interference.

25
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:56,160
Start frequency hopping. Re-establish comms.

26
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:56,840
Yes, sir.

27
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,640
1st Company, 2nd Company, do you copy?

28
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,920
The Red force's two reinforced companies

29
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,240
are basically wiped out.

30
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,240
Another half-dead one doesn't dare come out.

31
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,800
Also, the air assault forces given to them,

32
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,000
they haven't even used yet.

33
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,560
Their so-called "new-type" capabilities

34
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:09,840
are nowhere to be seen.

35
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,440
This battle is just...

36
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,080
Boring.

37
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,680
It really is unsatisfying.

38
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:18,480
I really don't know what Deputy Commander Liang

39
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,600
means by pulling this stunt.

40
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,760
Guo Zijian's Wind Rider Battalion

41
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,960
hasn't integrated well at all.

42
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:25,400
The so-called Cube is just a single module.

43
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,000
To be used as our test subjects,

44
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,000
they're completely unqualified.

45
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,360
I really don't know if Old Liang

46
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,480
let that news report

47
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,800
from a while back

48
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,160
go to his head.

49
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,720
Commander, you read that article in the military paper,

50
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,720
"The Concerns of a New-type Battalion Commander," right?

51
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,560
That kid Guo Zijian

52
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,120
got pretty popular because of that report.

53
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,320
I read it.

54
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,280
The article was quite practical.

55
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,840
The issues raised were deep,

56
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,800
and his thoughts on future battlefields were spot on.

57
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,320
But looking at it now,

58
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,920
they are merely

59
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,080
just thoughts.

60
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,840
This is the so-called,

61
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,320
"The greater the ability,

62
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,240
the greater the pressure."

63
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:56,920
Exactly.

64
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:59,000
Just look at our Blue Force community,

65
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,120
the most famous being Di Yunfeng.

66
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,280
He was crowned as the Blue Force Commander.

67
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,120
If he fights well, it's expected.

68
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,960
If he fights poorly,

69
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,040
he's not just embarrassing himself.

70
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,760
Commander, hearing you say this,

71
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,920
could it be sour grapes?

72
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,160
What are you saying?

73
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,840
However,

74
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,640
if we can make Guo Zijian's Wind Rider Battalion

75
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,360
expose its problems more thoroughly,

76
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,440
consider it a grand gift

77
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,800
from an old rival like me.

78
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:25,280
Right.

79
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,840
It's guarded by a special ops unit.

80
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,720
If I'm not mistaken,

81
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,240
that's the Blue Force command post.

82
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,440
Do we strike?

83
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,640
Of course we do.

84
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,320
But with just the few of us,

85
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,160
I'm afraid we're no match for them.

86
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,160
Then what's the plan?

87
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,880
Do you have the special ops frequency?

88
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,320
I do.

89
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,360
Good.

90
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,040
Contact Yang Maolin immediately.

91
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,000
No good. The jamming is too strong now.

92
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,360
My headset matches the Special Ops team's.

93
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,560
Let me try the intercom.

94
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,160
But even the radios are down.

95
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,880
The intercom frequency is so low,

96
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:51,760
it'll be even worse, right?

97
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,280
The jamming system mainly targets

98
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,880
the 2G to 4G frequency bands.

99
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,760
The transmission frequencies of these bands

100
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,080
are all above 2,000 hertz.

101
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,560
But the intercom is below 500 hertz,

102
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,600
so it avoids the jamming.

103
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,320
But walkie-talkies have a limited range.

104
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,640
We are equipped with

105
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,920
the latest short-wave intercom system.

106
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:07,800
We should be able to connect.

107
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:10,640
Honey Badger, Honey Badger.

108
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,200
Cheetah calling Honey Badger.

109
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,880
This is Honey Badger. Go ahead, Cheetah.

110
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:18,120
I found a suspected command center.

111
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,920
I need you to clear it personally.

112
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,200
Send me the coordinates.

113
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,480
I'll head there right away.

114
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,680
Remember the location.

115
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,520
It's an underground tunnel.

116
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,760
I'll send you the exact coordinates now.

117
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,200
We'll evacuate first.

118
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,240
Move out.

119
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,240
Cheetah, Cheetah.

120
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,960
Just now, the assault groups of Companies 2 and 3

121
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:02,400
took heavy fire from scattered infantry rockets.

122
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,920
The troops are scattered.

123
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
Please handle at your discretion.

124
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:05,680
Copy that.

125
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,480
Deputy Company Commander Xu,

126
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,960
return immediately to the company's equipment hideout,

127
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,880
and lead the team toward the town hall.

128
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,160
Listen up.

129
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,680
Once you move out,

130
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,720
you must keep the soldiers dispersed

131
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,200
and provide cross-cover for the heavy equipment.

132
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,240
Understood.

133
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,440
Those bastards have rockets,

134
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,040
but they're afraid of infantry.

135
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:26,920
What about you?

136
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,760
I'll head to the flanks of the town hall

137
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,000
to recover the scattered equipment of Companies 2 and 3.

138
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,680
Remember,

139
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:33,880
move fast.

140
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,400
Yes, sir.

141
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,080
Dongfang Qingtian,

142
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,680
why didn't you promptly report the attack on Companies 2 and 3?

143
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,800
The situation was critical just now.

144
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,760
I was just about to report it.

145
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,520
Where is your attack drone?

146
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:47,680
You trained with it for so long,

147
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:48,600
is it just for show?

148
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,040
Why didn't you provide support?

149
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:51,400
Staff Officer Zeng,

150
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,640
we are currently equipped with only one attack drone,

151
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,760
and it carries very few missiles.

152
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,560
I wanted to find the core target before striking.

153
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:58,800
Alright, I understand.

154
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:00,640
From now on,

155
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,440
you follow my command.

156
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,280
Coordinate with me to complete the strike on the town hall.

157
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,280
I will provide you with precise strike coordinates.

158
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:07,760
Copy that.

159
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,320
We missed that team just now.

160
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,080
Thought a few more teams would show up.

161
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,320
Didn't expect

162
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:06,120
only three little kittens to show up.

163
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,040
What a letdown.

164
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,600
Judging by this style,

165
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,880
it must be Old Yang.

166
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:18,800
So smart.

167
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,560
You got it right.

168
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,120
This is all good gear.

169
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,240
Take it.

170
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,120
Thanks, Deputy Company Commander.

171
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,360
Don't thank me.

172
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,800
Losing to you

173
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,440
is no disgrace.

174
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,760
Wild Wolf, Wild Wolf.

175
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:36,960
Report your status.

176
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:40,880
This is Wild Wolf.

177
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,160
Four Red-beaked Birds have been caged.

178
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,520
Copy that.

179
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:46,160
Not bad, Old Yang.

180
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,440
You nailed my accent.

181
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,720
When did you practice that?

182
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,200
Just a little casual practice.

183
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,800
Coordinates sent.

184
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,400
Target coordinates sent.

185
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,520
Fire!

186
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,320
Yes, sir!

187
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,000
Staff Officer Zeng.

188
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,800
The Blue Force is probably done for.

189
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,320
That was probably just a spent force.

190
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:40,440
Okay.

191
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:41,760
Deputy Company Commander Xu,

192
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,560
take a dozen men yourself

193
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,320
and cut in from the right rear of the town government building.

194
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:46,960
From there, you can access the roof directly.

195
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,040
Once we take the high ground,

196
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,280
the rest of the battle will be easy.

197
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:50,480
Yes, sir.

198
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,720
Until the very end,

199
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,080
don't declare victory too soon.

200
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,280
Smart kid.

201
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,320
He even used attack drones.

202
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,200
He turned the tables beautifully.

203
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,520
Zeng Muhan performed excellently this time.

204
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,200
Proving the battalion commander was right to trust him.

205
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,360
Adversity reveals true strength.

206
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,400
And turbulent times reveal heroes.

207
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,200
Those brats in the First Company.

208
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,040
When Zeng Muhan became their company commander,

209
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,120
they were completely against it.

210
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,600
But look at them now.

211
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,240
Wasn't it Zeng Muhan

212
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,000
who dragged them out of the mud?

213
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:19,440
Fall back!

214
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:00,760
We won!

215
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,600
We won!

216
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,440
We won!

217
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:10,840
Great work!

218
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:11,360
Congratulations!

219
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:11,720
Congratulations!

220
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,400
Good work, good work.

221
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:13,160
Good.

222
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:17,880
Reporting!

223
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,080
Battalion Commander!

224
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,480
Objective secured!

225
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:21,480
The exercise is over.

226
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,360
No.

227
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:36,120
That's not right.

228
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,640
The Blue Force's command post never appeared.

229
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:42,760
How could it be over?

230
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,320
What are you so happy about?

231
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,360
What are you so happy about?

232
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,200
Do you want the hostage?

233
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,680
Freshly captured hostage.

234
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:56,880
Great value.

235
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,320
Guaranteed authentic.

236
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,160
The King of Soldiers was captured.

237
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,800
It really is the King of Soldiers.

238
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,800
He'd be better off dead.

239
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:09,880
I heard the King of Soldiers

240
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,240
used to be in their brigade.

241
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:12,440
They're close.

242
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:13,400
Did he defect?

243
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,800
The battle is over.

244
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,000
Let the troops disperse.

245
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:17,880
We, the Blue Force,

246
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,160
suggest a truce.

247
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,280
If you refuse to accept this,

248
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,040
first,

249
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,000
there are still hostages in the tunnel.

250
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,720
We'll kill them one by one.

251
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:28,080
Second,

252
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,040
if you still want to fight,

253
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,120
that's fine too.

254
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,200
But it's essentially a bayonet fight.

255
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,720
There's no point anymore.

256
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:38,680
Commander Ma,

257
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:40,480
notify Exercise Control.

258
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:41,960
The exercise is over.

259
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:42,960
The result is pending.

260
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:43,720
Yes, sir.

261
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,640
Attention, Exercise Control.

262
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,360
Attention, Exercise Control.

263
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,640
The exercise ends here.

264
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,160
The result is pending.

265
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:54,840
Connect me via video.

266
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:56,640
I need to speak to

267
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,680
the commanders in the observation group.

268
00:17:57,840 --> 00:17:58,480
Yes, sir.

269
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:06,960
Commanders,

270
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,120
Professor Zhang.

271
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,080
The performance of the Wind Rider Battalion just now,

272
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,040
as you all saw,

273
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:12,600
had too many problems

274
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,360
for me to review one by one.

275
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,760
Today's observation concludes here.

276
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:19,680
Later, I will submit a detailed report

277
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:20,880
to all the commanders.

278
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:22,160
Old Long,

279
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,160
do you think we

280
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,480
had a bit too much fun?

281
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,760
With so many people watching,

282
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:27,520
Deputy Corps Commander Liang might lose face.

283
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:31,360
The value of the Blue Force's existence

284
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:32,920
is to expose

285
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:34,320
the problems within the Red Force.

286
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,480
Losing face now

287
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,760
is better than losing it later.

288
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:41,920
Guo Zijian's Wind Rider Battalion

289
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,080
has too many problems.

290
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:45,120
The more fun we have,

291
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:46,920
the more it helps them.

292
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,120
Didn't I tell you?

293
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,520
Just consider this time

294
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,560
a great gift from us to them.

295
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:58,200
Our Value Cube

296
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,080
really lost a lot of face today.

297
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:04,080
Even though

298
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,440
today's battle

299
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:08,160
ended up like this,

300
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:09,800
I personally feel

301
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:10,600
there are still many areas

302
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,680
that are commendable.

303
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,120
If there are problems,

304
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:14,640
we solve them.

305
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:16,320
There's no need to give up on ourselves.

306
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,040
I think what we really need to reflect on is

307
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:21,320
if we ever encounter

308
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:22,240
the same situation again in the future,

309
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,320
we absolutely must not

310
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:25,520
let our emotions

311
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:26,760
dictate our actions anymore.

312
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:28,160
Unless,

313
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,440
this time,

314
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:30,880
our Wind Rider Battalion

315
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:32,240
was truly crushed by them.

316
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:39,200
Win or lose,

317
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,280
I, Guo Zijian, can accept it.

318
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,120
But look at us.

319
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,880
From start to finish today,

320
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,920
our Cube didn't even spin.

321
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,920
It was all just individual modules spinning on their own.

322
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,080
I want to apologize first.

323
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:57,320
The first mistake today

324
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,320
was my fault.

325
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:02,000
I really wasn't in a good mood today,

326
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:06,200
and I couldn't concentrate for a while.

327
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,080
You two...

328
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,360
Didn't you feel it today,

329
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:22,480
that the atmosphere in this command vehicle

330
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,680
was off from start to finish?

331
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:25,920
You,

332
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:27,840
the chief staff officer.

333
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:29,400
And you,

334
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,120
the battalion commander.

335
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:36,120
You two are the core figures of this exercise.

336
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:39,600
With emotional issues between the two of you,

337
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,200
how can the Cube spin?

338
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:44,720
Even if this Cube did spin,

339
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:47,080
it would be spinning recklessly,

340
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,080
spinning blindly and in chaos.

341
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:54,720
Sang Haitian!

342
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:55,400
Here!

343
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,600
The battle is over.

344
00:20:57,320 --> 00:20:59,560
You have a very important mission to complete.

345
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:00,800
Awaiting your orders, sir!

346
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,480
I guarantee mission success!

347
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,240
Bring my Wind Rider Battalion

348
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:06,360
back to me completely intact.

349
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,760
If it's missing a single screw,

350
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:08,800
I'll hold you responsible.

351
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,120
Rest assured, Commissar.

352
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:11,200
I guarantee mission success!

353
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,760
As for the emotional issues,

354
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,360
now is not the time to resolve them.

355
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:15,680
Once we return to the camp,

356
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:17,040
get well fed and rested,

357
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:17,800
and calm down,

358
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:18,960
we can talk then.

359
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:20,000
Understood?

360
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:21,760
I guarantee we won't discuss emotions.

361
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:26,240
Guo Zijian!

362
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:29,880
Here!

363
00:21:30,320 --> 00:21:31,560
The Brigade Commander has something to say to you.

364
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:38,320
Guo Zijian!

365
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:39,200
Here!

366
00:21:40,320 --> 00:21:42,080
Do you have anything you want to say to me?

367
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,400
Reporting to the Brigade Commander,

368
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:43,880
I have nothing to say.

369
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:45,640
Let me tell you, Guo Zijian.

370
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:46,880
This battle,

371
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,000
on the surface, ended in a draw.

372
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:51,280
But it also exposed many problems.

373
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:52,880
Exposing them now

374
00:21:53,120 --> 00:21:54,600
might hurt our pride,

375
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:57,680
but for the long-term development of your Value Cube,

376
00:21:59,240 --> 00:21:59,960
it's not a bad thing.

377
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,560
If you

378
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:03,080
can't even see this point,

379
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:04,920
your role as Wind Rider Battalion Commander

380
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,960
is completely in vain.

381
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:07,400
I hope

382
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:10,120
you can be a qualified commander.

383
00:22:10,800 --> 00:22:11,200
Yes, sir.

384
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:13,360
Thank you, Brigade Commander.

385
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:15,360
I won't let you down.

386
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:25,520
Battalion Commander Guo...

387
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:26,400
That's enough.

388
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:28,520
We'll listen to our leaders.

389
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:30,640
The issues we need to discuss

390
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:32,120
will not be discussed here.

391
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:34,280
When we leave in a little while,

392
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:36,840
Yang Maolin and Liang Hong,

393
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:38,120
you'll come with me.

394
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:38,840
That won't be necessary.

395
00:22:40,520 --> 00:22:41,160
Instructor.

396
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,120
I'll go with you.

397
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:42,760
Alright.

398
00:22:59,120 --> 00:22:59,880
Feeling useless?

399
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,640
What do you mean, nodding and shaking your head?

400
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:07,840
Battalion Commander,

401
00:23:08,120 --> 00:23:09,640
please don't make me talk.

402
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:13,000
You know Long Yuanshan best in our battalion.

403
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,400
You must tell me the truth.

404
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:16,120
Actually,

405
00:23:16,760 --> 00:23:18,600
from the beginning when Staff Officer Zeng spotted them,

406
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:20,720
Brigade Commander Long had already set a trap.

407
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:23,040
He didn't capture Staff Officer Zeng right away

408
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,080
because he thought

409
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:26,240
the few men Zeng led were of little value.

410
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:28,720
I see.

411
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:32,440
Good thing he didn't capture Zeng Muhan.

412
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:33,920
Otherwise, we would've lost even worse.

413
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:37,840
Brigade Commander Long knows me too well.

414
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:39,760
I can't beat him.

415
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,400
What if I join you?

416
00:23:41,600 --> 00:23:43,040
Could the two of us beat him?

417
00:23:43,480 --> 00:23:44,640
Then it should be fifty-fifty.

418
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:47,120
Is Brigade Commander Long really that tough?

419
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:48,440
Battalion Commander,

420
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,760
didn't you just experience it yourself?

421
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:55,000
Yang Maolin,

422
00:23:55,320 --> 00:23:56,200
let me tell you,

423
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,760
no one is invincible.

424
00:23:59,040 --> 00:23:59,920
One day,

425
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:02,560
we will definitely defeat Long Yuanshan.

426
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,920
I've already made the calls.

427
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,520
Your mother's surgery was very successful.

428
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,560
She's out of danger now.

429
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:11,280
Don't worry.

430
00:24:11,560 --> 00:24:12,080
Once we get back,

431
00:24:12,080 --> 00:24:13,360
you can go see your mother first.

432
00:24:13,360 --> 00:24:14,760
I'll handle your leave.

433
00:24:16,280 --> 00:24:17,360
Thank you, Instructor.

434
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:21,840
Liang Hong,

435
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,720
with such a big family emergency,

436
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,160
why did you wait until the end of the exercise

437
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:26,160
to tell me?

438
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:27,760
Our unit

439
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,320
isn't completely heartless.

440
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:31,600
Of course,

441
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:33,960
your willingness to put the greater good

442
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:34,800
before your own family

443
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:35,640
is a spirit

444
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,200
we should all learn from.

445
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,040
But

446
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:42,320
some things are just too hard to shoulder

447
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:44,520
all by yourself.

448
00:24:45,280 --> 00:24:46,520
Have you noticed

449
00:24:47,280 --> 00:24:48,360
that our Wind Rider Battalion

450
00:24:49,120 --> 00:24:50,600
is full of heroes,

451
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,080
but why is it

452
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:54,280
that every time we're grouped together,

453
00:24:54,280 --> 00:24:55,760
the results are less than ideal?

454
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,200
Don't you think

455
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,040
this is also one of the reasons

456
00:24:59,040 --> 00:25:00,320
our Value Cube has never

457
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:01,400
truly started working?

458
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,520
You guys love taking on every hardship

459
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:06,080
all by yourselves,

460
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:08,360
and refuse to ask for help.

461
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:11,200
Thank you, Instructor.

462
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,680
This family emergency

463
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:15,520
happened a bit too suddenly,

464
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,160
right during the exercise.

465
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:21,760
I know where my duty lies.

466
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:24,520
On this point,

467
00:25:26,520 --> 00:25:27,960
I trust you completely.

468
00:25:28,800 --> 00:25:30,280
The reason Guo Zijian lost his temper with you

469
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,840
was because we didn't do well in this exercise.

470
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:35,000
He was anxious, so he lashed out.

471
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:38,080
I'll definitely give him a good scolding.

472
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:41,920
He didn't do anything wrong.

473
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:43,240
I was the one who wasn't professional enough.

474
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:50,080
You two can be quite cute sometimes.

475
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:52,280
He just asked you to go back with him.

476
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,720
You didn't want to share a car with him.

477
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,960
And now you're speaking up for him again.

478
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:59,040
I just don't want to see him right now.

479
00:26:01,600 --> 00:26:03,200
Maybe I'm really not fit

480
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:05,840
to be his

481
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:07,360
chief of staff.

482
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,200
Liang Hong.

483
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:13,960
We've been

484
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,160
colleagues,

485
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:16,120
working together

486
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,080
for quite some time now.

487
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,760
My experience tells me

488
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:21,800
if you, Liang Hong,

489
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:24,720
can't be this chief of staff,

490
00:26:25,800 --> 00:26:27,760
then no one else can.

491
00:26:30,280 --> 00:26:31,200
And I firmly believe

492
00:26:32,040 --> 00:26:33,120
the Sword and Rainbow

493
00:26:33,120 --> 00:26:34,840
duo will one day

494
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,000
become truly invincible.

495
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:42,040
Instructor, why are you also...

496
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:42,800
Liang Hong.

497
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:44,760
I really,

498
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:48,040
truly love

499
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,720
the Sword and Rainbow duo.

500
00:26:52,320 --> 00:26:53,600
I strongly believe

501
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:56,880
that as long as you two

502
00:26:57,520 --> 00:26:58,520
are in the Wind Rider Battalion,

503
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,400
our Value Cube

504
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,480
will soon

505
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:04,480
truly start turning.

506
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:06,560
But the prerequisite

507
00:27:08,080 --> 00:27:09,480
is that we must deal with

508
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:11,240
Guo Zijian's awful temper.

509
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:17,320
Thanks.

510
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,000
After talking to you,

511
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,400
I feel a lot better.

512
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:36,840
Your sister-in-law

513
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,440
got me some green tea.

514
00:27:38,720 --> 00:27:39,520
It's pretty good.

515
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:40,520
Try some.

516
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,360
It's tinder-dry.

517
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:43,560
Have a sip

518
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:44,600
to cool down.

519
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:47,120
How can you still drink tea at a time like this?

520
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:48,600
A time like what?

521
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:51,520
Regarding this exercise,

522
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:52,880
I conducted a Debriefing.

523
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:55,880
The more I think about it, the angrier I get.

524
00:27:56,120 --> 00:27:57,880
How could we fight such a terrible battle?

525
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,760
This time,

526
00:28:01,560 --> 00:28:02,440
our Wind Rider Battalion

527
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:04,120
completely humiliated ourselves.

528
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:08,640
Do you feel like

529
00:28:09,360 --> 00:28:10,320
there's no way

530
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:13,720
to answer to the brigade commander who trusted you?

531
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,400
And even less of a way

532
00:28:15,760 --> 00:28:17,640
to answer to all the troops of the Wind Rider Battalion?

533
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:19,000
More importantly,

534
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:20,720
there's no way

535
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,560
to answer to yourself?

536
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:23,600
Yeah.

537
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,120
I can't answer to anyone.

538
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:26,960
It's true.

539
00:28:28,360 --> 00:28:29,760
Liang Hong said the same thing.

540
00:28:35,280 --> 00:28:35,960
Where is she?

541
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,000
She hasn't shown her face since getting back.

542
00:28:38,280 --> 00:28:39,520
Tell her to come over for a meeting.

543
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:40,560
For a Debriefing.

544
00:28:40,840 --> 00:28:41,560
What Debriefing?

545
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,400
Liang Hong

546
00:28:45,560 --> 00:28:47,280
has already submitted her transfer request.

547
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,160
Transfer?

548
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:50,600
Transfer where?

549
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:51,280
I don't know.

550
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:53,080
But her transfer report has already been submitted.

551
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,160
Submitted to whom?

552
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,320
I'm her superior!

553
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:56,280
To the brigade commander.

554
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:58,880
This is absurd!

555
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:00,000
Why didn't you stop her?

556
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,120
I'm going to find her.

557
00:29:08,040 --> 00:29:08,720
Hong Xiafei

558
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:10,440
Battalion Commander Guo

559
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:12,440
Where's Liang Hong?

560
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:13,680
She left.

561
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,600
She left?

562
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:15,960
The report hasn't been approved yet.

563
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:16,760
Who said she could leave?

564
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:18,200
Before the exercise started,

565
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,960
her mother was hospitalized with a heart condition.

566
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:22,320
She originally wanted to take a leave to go back,

567
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:23,720
but the exercise delayed her.

568
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:24,840
Now that the exercise is over,

569
00:29:24,840 --> 00:29:26,160
shouldn't she be allowed to go see her?

570
00:29:26,680 --> 00:29:27,640
Hospitalized?

571
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:30,000
Why didn't she tell me beforehand?

572
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:32,480
Did you even give her a chance to explain?

573
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:35,080
You're unreasonable and only know how to yell.

574
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:37,760
When is she coming back?

575
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:40,120
That depends on when Battalion Commander Guo approves

576
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:41,160
the transfer report.

577
00:29:41,320 --> 00:29:42,400
What report?

578
00:29:43,320 --> 00:29:44,040
If she contacts you,

