874
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,400
Stop beating around the bush.

875
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:13,880
Get straight to the point.

876
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:15,120
Yes, sir.

877
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,120
This time,

878
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:18,920
in terms of personnel deployment alone,

879
00:41:19,240 --> 00:41:20,320
I made many mistakes.

880
