883
00:41:28,080 --> 00:41:29,520
This was my biggest mistake.

884
00:41:30,600 --> 00:41:31,160
Also,

885
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:32,760
the deployment of Yang Maolin.

886
00:41:33,080 --> 00:41:34,080
Another King of Soldiers.

887
00:41:34,480 --> 00:41:35,160
Tell me about it.

888
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:36,640
Obviously, Long Yuanshan

889
