understands him better than I do.

890
00:41:38,720 --> 00:41:40,600
Yet I still delivered him right into Long Yuanshan's hands.

891
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:43,080
This was caused by my overconfidence

892
00:41:43,680 --> 00:41:45,320
and severe underestimation of the enemy.

893
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:47,400
Continue.

894
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:48,320
Second,

895
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:49,840
our internal dynamics.

896
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:51,960
Due to my personality traits,

897
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:54,480
