901
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:01,240
Third,

902
00:42:01,680 --> 00:42:02,800
in terms of force composition,

903
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:03,920
I failed to balance everything.

904
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:05,720
Due to my overthinking and hesitation,

905
00:42:06,440 --> 00:42:08,640
the air assault forces assigned to us

906
00:42:08,760 --> 00:42:09,760
were not utilized at all.

907
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:12,280
Coupled with the improper use of the special ops platoon,

908
00:42:12,720 --> 00:42:15,440
and inadequate integration of other new-type forces,

909
00:42:15,560 --> 00:42:16,160
it resulted in

910
00:42:16,680 --> 00:42:17,680
a complete failure to demonstrate

911
00:42:17,680 --> 00:42:19,560
the unique strengths of our new-type combat battalion.

912
00:42:20,160 --> 00:42:20,760
Fourth,

913
00:42:21,040 --> 00:42:22,800
in urban offensive and defensive operations,

914
00:42:23,160 --> 00:42:25,200
the effort and research we invested

915
00:42:25,200 --> 00:42:26,120
were still insufficient.

916
00:42:26,480 --> 00:42:27,760
As a result, once on site,

917
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:29,560
we found it was a completely different story.

918
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:30,560
Therefore,

919
00:42:30,680 --> 00:42:31,880
the officers and soldiers couldn't adapt,

920
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,160
and fought many disorganized battles.

921
00:42:33,560 --> 00:42:34,080
Fifth,

922
00:42:34,720 --> 00:42:36,120
the casualty recovery system

923
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:37,640
was inaccurate and unrefined.

924
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:38,720
This time,

925
00:42:39,120 --> 00:42:41,200
if Zeng Muhan hadn't stepped up

926
00:42:41,560 --> 00:42:42,600
in the final stage,

927
00:42:42,880 --> 00:42:44,280
we would have never been able to complete

928
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,880
the siege on the town hall.

929
00:42:46,240 --> 00:42:46,840
Therefore,

930
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:49,600
